      "trackName": "Five Line: Gomoku",
      "description": "Five Line — the classic five-in-a-row strategy game, built for Apple Watch.\n\nTake turns placing stones on the grid. Be the first to line up five in a row — across, down, or diagonal — while blocking a smart AI that gets sharper as you do. Pure strategy, now on your wrist. No phone needed.\n\nWHY YOU'LL LOVE IT\n• Tap to place a stone — Digital Crown to aim on bigger boards\n• AI that scales from gentle to expert (smooth difficulty curve)\n• Board sizes from 9×9 to 15×15\n• Quick, deep strategy in 2-5 minutes\n• Play fully offline, anytime\n• Progress & stats saved automatically\n• Built native for Apple Watch",
